## Visual Patterns

### Pipeline
```
●──→●──→●──→●
   linear flow
```

### Diamond
```
    ●
   ╱ ╲
  ●   ●
   ╲ ╱
    ●
```

### Star (Hub-Spoke)
```
    ●
   ╱│╲╲
  ● ● ● ●
```

### Map-Reduce
```
[●,●,●,●]
    │ map
 ┌──┼──┐
 ●  ●  ●  (parallel)
 │  │  │
 └──┼──┘
    │ reduce
    ●
```

